  @invariant  pins (col,row,part); overwrites a place keep-below, steps the sub-caret right  @ 1487
  @invariant  field re-read via cells[row] each keystroke; undo snapshots drive backspace-restore  @ 1488
  @contract  target, facility and key are remembered at take tier; the rest is per invocation  @ 2387
  @contract  with no target the whole of it is the notation snap  @ 2388
  @contract  the facility reads the target as points of the pitch line or as moves between strands  @ 2389
  @contract  purity is the moves facility's alone: how nearly a spelled interval sounds pure  @ 2390
